As noted <a href="https://mobilesyrup.com/2026/07/27/applecare-subscription-change/">by <em>MobileSyrup</em></a>, monthly and annual AppleCare+ subscriptions are <a href="https://www.apple.com/ca/applecare/">now available</a> for a wider range of products in Canada, including the iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple Watch, Apple TV, AirPods, HomePod, Studio Display, and Vision Pro.<br/>
