For example, AppleCare+ coverage for a Mac starts at &#36;5.49 per month or &#36;54.99 per year, with prices varying by model. For lower-priced devices like the Apple TV and HomePod, coverage is available for as little as &#36;0.99 per month or &#36;9.99 per year.<br/>
<br/>
